<https://example.org/crgo-sample/nordelle/assumption/profile-reading> a owl:NamedIndividual,
        crgo:CRGO_0000339 ;
    rdfs:label "Reading of the organisation profile"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Organisation profile read as given: a listed value is a fact; an unlisted value counts as absent only for the properties the profile declares complete (profile complete for); otherwise it is unknown."@en .

